  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "使用量與現況的證據界線",
      "description": "先呈現目前是否仍有資料、所選時間範圍的 token／費用／回合與估價品質，再把 provider 特有欄位放到細節區。",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 先確認資料新鮮度，再閱讀所選範圍用量\n\n上排全部以目前篩選器與 dashboard 時間範圍計算。**Provider-reported accounting** 目前可把 Codex token 整理成不重複分類；Estimated cost 只在 exact `model_id` 對到版本化 rate card 時估算。它採公開 API 基礎牌價，**不是**訂閱、Enterprise contract、credits 或實際帳單。Extension-observed snapshots 只在支援的產品出現，已收進下方摺疊區。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Telemetry 距今",
      "description": "最後一筆符合目前 provider／product／model 篩選的 token telemetry 距離現在多久；超過 5 分鐘轉黃、15 分鐘轉紅。",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 300
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 900
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "time() - max(timestamp(ai_agent_turn_token_usage_sum{ai_agent_provider=~\"$provider\",ai_agent_product=~\"$product\",model_id=~\"$model_id\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost)?-fixture$\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "距今秒數",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "所選範圍 Token",
      "description": "所選時間範圍內 canonical accounting token 增量；cached 與 cache-write 不會和 input 重複。",
